{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Vekunel 是一款協助網購前比較加購後總支出的計算工具，適合經常為湊免運而猶豫的消費者。你可輸入原購物車小計、一般運費、免運門檻與加購商品價格，快速看出加購前後實際付款總額及差額，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-122.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>加購免運快速比較</h2>\n<p>輸入四項金額後，Vekunel 會顯示加購前後付款總額與差額計算，並標示額外商品是否符合免運，讓你判斷加購是否值得。四項金額須使用同一貨幣，切換貨幣不會換算；工具假設免運門檻以輸入的購物車小計計算，稅項、優惠券、其他費用、退款與獎勵積分均不自動推算。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-125-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-127-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-128-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Vekunel</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/vekunel/id6821840147?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:02:15.761389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:44:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:50.265123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:59:10.681070+00:00","content_hash":"5391c668d4a067b8521d338546f35dce96ad2d618f6fab4d5d77d7ddeedb6309","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}